    "turn_idx": 31,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, absolutely. I mean, like I said, I stay away from any kind of optimism on all of them. But yeah, the issue has been called out and people have been called out on all of those. And that brings me to really the next question is, Because of that because these are a lot of them are The minimum wage has come up and been defeated The school stuff has been I think we can I mean I think it's fair to say it's been it's been Stonewalled. I mean it's been it's been you know Nobody would drop the suit. We're gonna let it play out like nobody wants to nobody wants to take action like it's like kick the can down the road I Same with marijuana. There's no good reason not to do it other than just people's general feelings. How are",
